(7620979, 1233817, 99263, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha lol very funny. Did you have this joke in mind and then went out to photograph it to illustrate the joke or did the joke come to mind you after you had taken the photograph? If you went to photograph with the joke in mind it must have taken a lot of patience and lots of shots to eventually get the fish in the correct positions to illustrate the joke effectively. If it was a case of just shooting fish without the joke in mind then you got very lucky that the fish posed in this way and that the idea of the joke then came to mind......Whichever or whatever...it''s great :)</td>', 'Ha ha ha lol very funny. Did you have this joke in mind and then went out to photograph it to illustrate the joke or did the joke come to mind you after you had taken the photograph? If you went to photograph with the joke in mind it must have taken a lot of patience and lots of shots to eventually get the fish in the correct positions to illustrate the joke effectively. If it was a case of just shooting fish without the joke in mind then you got very lucky that the fish posed in this way and that the idea of the joke then came to mind......Whichever or whatever...it''s great :)', '2019-03-21 06:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
