(7622290, 1234433, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> So what kind of fish are they and what did you do with them next! My cats love this picture. Congrats on the yellow. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am not fish expert but I believe the fish monger said they are sprats. They were very cheap and I suspect they were riddled with bones so I didn''t eat them. I had intended to buy sardines but they didn''t have any so I got these instead. When I suggested this challenge I had intentions to do something more adventurous but life got in the way and it was a last minute simple photo. <br/> <br/>The sardines I was just going to replicate this photo I took about a year ago - again very simple and on the same slate tile<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1234904" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1234904.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1234904.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1234904.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: So what kind of fish are they and what did you do with them next! My cats love this picture. Congrats on the yellow.   I am not fish expert but I believe the fish monger said they are sprats. They were very cheap and I suspect they were riddled with bones so I didn''t eat them. I had intended to buy sardines but they didn''t have any so I got these instead. When I suggested this challenge I had intentions to do something more adventurous but life got in the way and it was a last minute simple photo.  The sardines I was just going to replicate this photo I took about a year ago - again very simple and on the same slate tile ', '2019-03-28 07:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
